*-----------------------------------------------------------------------
*  ADSC DIALOG DEFINITION      EMPLOYEE CAR INQUIRY
*-----------------------------------------------------------------------
ADD DIALOG FLEEMPI VERSION 1
    DESCRIPTION IS 'EMPLOYEE CAR INQUIRY'
    SUBSCHEMA IS FLEETSS1 OF SCHEMA FLEETSCH VERSION 1
    MAP IS FLEEMPIM VERSION 1
    WORK RECORD IS FLEWORK
    PREMAP PROCESS IS FLEEMPI-PREMAP
    RESPONSE PROCESS IS FLEEMPI-ENTER  RESPONSE KEY IS ENTER
       EXECUTE ON EDIT ERRORS
    RESPONSE PROCESS IS FLEEMPI-PF3    RESPONSE KEY IS PF3
    .
